{"4252600":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Keystroke Pursuit","steam_appid":4252600,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keystroke Pursuit<\/strong> is a typing chase game where you play the getaway. You're a raccoon thief speeding through a 3D toy town, and Sgt. Shiba, a very determined police dog, is right behind you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your typing is the engine. Type the passage fast and clean and your car pulls away. Hesitate or mistype and the siren gets louder. Keep a streak going to fire up nitro, dodge roadblocks with a quick burst, and decide at every fork whether a piece of loot is worth the seconds it costs.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Case Files campaign:<\/strong> 18 heists across four districts. Start with a morning-market teapot job and night runs where only your headlights reveal the words ahead, then hit a fog-bound harbour where you freeze whenever a police helicopter's searchlight finds you, and a gallery's night opening where one wrong key inside a laser zone sets off the alarm.<br><\/li><li><strong>A story in 3D cutscenes:<\/strong> Sgt. Shiba upgrades his kit district by district. The harbour and the gallery each end in a boss case, all the way to a sunrise finale over Key City.<br><\/li><li><strong>Three-star scoring:<\/strong> every case has a score and bonus objectives, so there's always a cleaner, faster getaway to go back for.<br><\/li><li><strong>Loot to collect:<\/strong> 55 stolen treasures to grab mid-chase and show off in your hideout.<br><\/li><li><strong>Tune your getaway car:<\/strong> earn talent points and fit parts in the garage (steady tyres, sprint engines, trick gadgets), each with its own trade-off.<br><\/li><li><strong>A rival with personality:<\/strong> Sgt. Shiba has something to say about every run, and never quite gives up.<br><\/li><li><strong>Real books to type:<\/strong> passages from public-domain classics in nine topics: detective stories, English classics, sea adventures, science and nature, fairy tales and fables, classic poetry, stage comedy, wit and wisdom, and golden-age detective fiction. Type Shakespeare, Poe and Keats, Oscar Wilde, Bernard Shaw and Gilbert &amp; Sullivan, Mark Twain, G. K. Chesterton, Maurice Leblanc and Emily Brontë, and pick your run length.<br><\/li><li><strong>Quick chases:<\/strong> free escape runs, or swap sides and play the police in a pursuit.<br><\/li><li><strong>Cosmetics, no microtransactions:<\/strong> spend in-game coins on paint jobs, typing-panel themes, trails and hats.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interface is available in English and Simplified Chinese. Typing passages are in English. A physical keyboard is required.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keystroke Pursuit<\/strong> is a typing chase game where you play the getaway. You're a raccoon thief speeding through a 3D toy town, and Sgt. Shiba, a very determined police dog, is right behind you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your typing is the engine. Type the passage fast and clean and your car pulls away. Hesitate or mistype and the siren gets louder. Keep a streak going to fire up nitro, dodge roadblocks with a quick burst, and decide at every fork whether a piece of loot is worth the seconds it costs.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Case Files campaign:<\/strong> 18 heists across four districts. Start with a morning-market teapot job and night runs where only your headlights reveal the words ahead, then hit a fog-bound harbour where you freeze whenever a police helicopter's searchlight finds you, and a gallery's night opening where one wrong key inside a laser zone sets off the alarm.<br><\/li><li><strong>A story in 3D cutscenes:<\/strong> Sgt. Shiba upgrades his kit district by district. The harbour and the gallery each end in a boss case, all the way to a sunrise finale over Key City.<br><\/li><li><strong>Three-star scoring:<\/strong> every case has a score and bonus objectives, so there's always a cleaner, faster getaway to go back for.<br><\/li><li><strong>Loot to collect:<\/strong> 55 stolen treasures to grab mid-chase and show off in your hideout.<br><\/li><li><strong>Tune your getaway car:<\/strong> earn talent points and fit parts in the garage (steady tyres, sprint engines, trick gadgets), each with its own trade-off.<br><\/li><li><strong>A rival with personality:<\/strong> Sgt. Shiba has something to say about every run, and never quite gives up.<br><\/li><li><strong>Real books to type:<\/strong> passages from public-domain classics in nine topics: detective stories, English classics, sea adventures, science and nature, fairy tales and fables, classic poetry, stage comedy, wit and wisdom, and golden-age detective fiction. Type Shakespeare, Poe and Keats, Oscar Wilde, Bernard Shaw and Gilbert &amp; Sullivan, Mark Twain, G. K. Chesterton, Maurice Leblanc and Emily Brontë, and pick your run length.<br><\/li><li><strong>Quick chases:<\/strong> free escape runs, or swap sides and play the police in a pursuit.<br><\/li><li><strong>Cosmetics, no microtransactions:<\/strong> spend in-game coins on paint jobs, typing-panel themes, trails and hats.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interface is available in English and Simplified Chinese. Typing passages are in English. A physical keyboard is required.<\/p>","short_description":"Type to escape! You're a raccoon thief racing through a toy-like 3D city with Sgt. Shiba on your tail. Clean, fast words speed up your getaway car; every typo lets the sirens close in. Grab loot, freeze in the searchlight, sneak past the lasers and chase three stars on every case.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4252600\/52d5a7790f19a816360ddb786557a593bed16300\/header.jpg?t=1793728776","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4252600\/01e0857923901c428d871b27e81569b81ccac606\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793728776","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4252600\/01e0857923901c428d871b27e81569b81ccac606\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793728776","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent dual-core CPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 \/ WebGL 2 capable GPU (Intel UHD Graphics 620 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> A physical keyboard is required.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 \/ AMD Ryzen 5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 \/ AMD Radeon RX 560 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> A physical keyboard is required.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><